.DS_Store

# THE FLEET CONFIG IS NEVER COMMITTED.
#
# Its mere presence in the extension folder makes an install fleet-managed: it
# is re-applied on every launch and overwrites local settings. Committing one
# would do that to everybody who checks the repo out — and it carries a
# character token. Copy presets.example.json to presets.json locally instead.
presets.json
